Key Features Built-In:
1. Interactive Command-Loop: You can run annual turn-based progression or dynamically alter variables at any point.

2. Economic System: Tax revenue flows into the treasury, and changing tax rates affects citizen stability and currency valuation.

3. Resource & Population Mechanics: Water and food reserves drain annually depending on population size. Shortages cause public instability and population decline.

4. Custom Parameter Adjustments: Option [2] allows you to directly overwrite any variable (population, currency rate, stability, water levels) during runtime.
